From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:38:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(gitops): build the workflow files from the picked
 databases (BYT-10423)

generateWorkflowFiles returns every file for the identity's git provider:
one deploy job per environment in deploy order, the default branch read
at run time, and the migration folder as the trigger and file pattern.
The old generators stay until the page moves to the new one.
---
